  "sourceTitle": "Cheese Ravioli Filling",
  "sourceText": "Cheese Ravioli Filling\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 26, 2010 - 11:40pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 lg. carton Ricotta\n2 bunches spinach\n1 handful parsley\n1 cup grated cheese\n2 egg whites\nNutmeg\nSalt\npepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook spinach, squeeze out water and chop. Chop parsley and add other ingredients and proceed to make Ravioli as in meat ravioli. See Ravioli Dough for assembly.",
